From: QING23qin <112809742+QING23qin@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 27 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] cgroup: allow namespace root to host nested controllers

Allow the cgroup namespace root to contain both the monitor task and
nested domain controllers, as required by the DroidSpaces layout.

---
 kernel/cgroup/cgroup.c | 12 +++++++++++-
 1 file changed, 11 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/kernel/cgroup/cgroup.c b/kernel/cgroup/cgroup.c
--- a/kernel/cgroup/cgroup.c
+++ b/kernel/cgroup/cgroup.c
@@ -320,3 +320,13 @@
 	 * root and a parent of resource domains at the same time.
-	return !cgroup_parent(cgrp);
+	if (!cgroup_parent(cgrp))
+		return true;
+
+	/*
+	 * DroidSpaces uses a container cgroup as the root of a cgroup
+	 * namespace and intentionally keeps its monitor in that cgroup.
+	 * Allow that namespace root to host nested resource domains.
+	 */
+	if (current->nsproxy && current->nsproxy->cgroup_ns &&
+	    current->nsproxy->cgroup_ns->root_cset->dfl_cgrp == cgrp)
+		return true;
+
+	return false;
+ /* can @cgrp become a thread root? should always be true for a thread root */
